{"k":"hyp","t":"Hyperbola","cls":"11","u":"Coordinate Geometry","s":[["Standard hyperbola",[{"q":"Standard hyperbola","f":"\\frac{x^2}{a^2}-\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1,\\quad b^2=a^2(e^2-1)","g":"p=1.5*cosh(t),1*sinh(t),-2,2 | p=-1.5*cosh(t),1*sinh(t),-2,2 | y=x/1.5 | y=-x/1.5 ; -5,5,-3.5,3.5","n":"Foci $(\\pm ae,0)$, directrices $x=\\pm\\frac ae$, latus rectum $\\frac{2b^2}a$, transverse axis $2a$, conjugate axis $2b$."},{"q":"Focal distance property","f":"|SP-S'P|=2a;\\qquad SP=ex_1-a,\\ S'P=ex_1+a\\ (\\text{right branch})"},{"q":"Conjugate hyperbola","f":"-\\frac{x^2}{a^2}+\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1;\\qquad\\frac1{e_1^2}+\\frac1{e_2^2}=1"},{"q":"Parametric point","f":"(a\\sec\\theta,\\ b\\tan\\theta)\\quad\\text{or}\\quad(a\\cosh t,\\ b\\sinh t)"},{"q":"Asymptotes","f":"\\frac xa\\pm\\frac yb=0\\ \\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\pm\\frac bax","n":"Angle between asymptotes $=2\\tan^{-1}\\frac ba$. Equation of the hyperbola and of its asymptotes differ only by a constant: $H=0$, $A=H+k$, conjugate $=2A-H$."},{"q":"Eccentricity from axes","f":"e=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{b^2}{a^2}}"},{"q":"Ends of latus rectum and directrix distance","f":"\\left(\\pm ae,\\ \\pm\\frac{b^2}a\\right);\\qquad\\text{distance between directrices}=\\frac{2a}e"},{"q":"Shifted hyperbola","f":"\\frac{(x-h)^2}{a^2}-\\frac{(y-k)^2}{b^2}=1:\\ \\text{centre }(h,k)"},{"q":"Hyperbola with vertical transverse axis","f":"\\frac{y^2}{b^2}-\\frac{x^2}{a^2}=1:\\ e=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{a^2}{b^2}},\\ \\text{foci }(0,\\pm be)"},{"q":"Position of a point","f":"S_1=\\frac{x_1^2}{a^2}-\\frac{y_1^2}{b^2}-1:\\ >0\\ \\text{inside (focus side)},\\ <0\\ \\text{outside}"}]],["Tangents and normals",[{"q":"Tangent at $(x_1,y_1)$ and at $\\theta$","f":"\\frac{xx_1}{a^2}-\\frac{yy_1}{b^2}=1;\\qquad\\frac{x\\sec\\theta}a-\\frac{y\\tan\\theta}b=1"},{"q":"Slope form and tangency condition","f":"y=mx\\pm\\sqrt{a^2m^2-b^2};\\qquad c^2=a^2m^2-b^2","n":"Requires $|m|>\\frac ba$."},{"q":"Normal at $(x_1,y_1)$ and at $\\theta$","f":"\\frac{a^2x}{x_1}+\\frac{b^2y}{y_1}=a^2+b^2;\\qquad ax\\cos\\theta+by\\cot\\theta=a^2+b^2"},{"q":"Director circle","f":"x^2+y^2=a^2-b^2","n":"Exists only if $a>b$."},{"q":"Chord of contact, midpoint chord, pair of tangents","f":"T=0,\\qquad T=S_1,\\qquad SS_1=T^2"},{"q":"Tangents from a point (slopes)","f":"(x_1^2-a^2)m^2-2x_1y_1m+(y_1^2+b^2)=0"},{"q":"Chord with given midpoint","f":"\\frac{xx_1}{a^2}-\\frac{yy_1}{b^2}=\\frac{x_1^2}{a^2}-\\frac{y_1^2}{b^2}"},{"q":"Chord joining $\\theta_1$, $\\theta_2$ (sec–tan form)","f":"\\frac xa\\cos\\frac{\\theta_1-\\theta_2}2-\\frac yb\\sin\\frac{\\theta_1+\\theta_2}2=\\cos\\frac{\\theta_1+\\theta_2}2"},{"q":"Normal slope form","f":"y=mx\\mp\\frac{(a^2+b^2)m}{\\sqrt{a^2-b^2m^2}}"}]],["Rectangular hyperbola",[{"q":"Rectangular hyperbola","f":"x^2-y^2=a^2,\\ e=\\sqrt2;\\qquad xy=c^2","g":"y=1/x ; -5,5,-5,5","n":"Asymptotes of $xy=c^2$ are the axes; vertices $(\\pm c,\\pm c)$; foci $(\\pm\\sqrt2c,\\pm\\sqrt2c)$."},{"q":"Parametric point and tangent of $xy=c^2$","f":"\\left(ct,\\frac ct\\right);\\qquad\\frac xt+yt=2c","n":"Tangent at $(x_1,y_1)$: $xy_1+yx_1=2c^2$."},{"q":"Normal of $xy=c^2$ at $t$","f":"xt^3-yt-ct^4+c=0"},{"q":"Chord joining $t_1,t_2$ on $xy=c^2$","f":"x+t_1t_2y=c(t_1+t_2)"},{"q":"Rectangular hyperbola $xy=c^2$ properties","f":"e=\\sqrt2,\\ \\text{LR}=2\\sqrt2\\,c,\\ \\text{directrices } x+y=\\pm\\sqrt2\\,c"},{"q":"Tangent of $xy=c^2$ in slope form","f":"y=mx\\pm2c\\sqrt{-m}\\quad(m<0)"},{"q":"Intersection of tangents at $t_1$, $t_2$ on $xy=c^2$","f":"\\left(\\frac{2ct_1t_2}{t_1+t_2},\\ \\frac{2c}{t_1+t_2}\\right)"},{"q":"Normal at $t$ meets the curve again at $t'$","f":"t'=-\\frac1{t^3}"},{"q":"Hyperbola $xy=k$ after rotation","f":"x^2-y^2=a^2\\ \\text{rotated by } 45^\\circ\\ \\text{gives}\\ xy=\\frac{a^2}2"}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Product of perpendiculars from foci to a tangent","f":"p_1p_2=b^2"},{"q":"Area of triangle formed by a tangent and the asymptotes","f":"ab\\ (\\text{constant})","n":"The point of contact is the midpoint of the intercept between the asymptotes."},{"q":"Product of distances from a point to the asymptotes","f":"\\frac{a^2b^2}{a^2+b^2}"},{"q":"Reflection property","f":"\\text{tangent bisects the angle between focal radii (internally)}"},{"q":"Triangle inscribed in $xy=c^2$","f":"\\text{orthocentre also lies on the hyperbola}"},{"q":"A circle meeting $xy=c^2$ at four points $t_1,\\dots,t_4$","f":"t_1t_2t_3t_4=1","n":"Also the centroid of the four points is the midpoint of the circle's centre and the hyperbola's centre."},{"q":"Conjugate diameters of a hyperbola","f":"m_1m_2=\\frac{b^2}{a^2}"},{"q":"Angle between asymptotes and eccentricity","f":"\\theta=2\\tan^{-1}\\frac ba,\\qquad e=\\sec\\frac\\theta2"},{"q":"Locus of the foot of perpendicular from a focus to a tangent","f":"\\text{auxiliary circle } x^2+y^2=a^2"},{"q":"Intersection of hyperbola and conjugate hyperbola","f":"\\text{they never meet (for real points)};\\ \\text{asymptotes are shared}"},{"q":"Area of the triangle formed by a tangent and asymptotes of $xy=c^2$","f":"2c^2"}]],["If this type comes, solve like this",[{"q":"If foci, directrix, $e$, LR or focal distances are given","f":"b^2=a^2(e^2-1),\\ \\ \\text{LR}=\\frac{2b^2}a,\\ \\ |SP-S'P|=2a,\\ \\ SP\\cdot S'P=e^2x^2-a^2","n":"For a vertical hyperbola (foci on $x=1$, etc.) swap roles of $x$ and $y$. Conjugate hyperbola: $\\frac1{e_1^2}+\\frac1{e_2^2}=1$.","p":"12 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 25 times"},{"q":"If it shares foci/vertices with an ellipse","f":"\\text{ellipse foci } (\\pm ae,0)\\ \\text{with } a^2e^2=a^2-b^2;\\ \\ \\text{hyperbola: } a^2e^2=a^2+b^2","p":"10 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 20 times"},{"q":"If a line does not meet / touches the hyperbola","f":"c^2=a^2m^2-b^2\\ \\text{(tangent)};\\ \\text{no intersection: solve for } x,\\ D<0","p":"5 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 5 times"},{"q":"If rectangular hyperbola $xy=c^2$ points/chords","f":"(ct,\\tfrac ct);\\ \\text{chord midpoint } (h,k)\\Rightarrow\\text{chord } \\tfrac xh+\\tfrac yk=2","p":"2 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 2 times"},{"q":"If locus of a point of intersection / centroid","f":"\\text{eliminate the parameter: } \\sec^2-\\tan^2=1\\ \\text{or } k\\cdot\\tfrac1k","p":"4 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 5 times"}]]]}